  text: The Team: Revenue Operations – Americas
  text: You’ll join a hands-on Revenue Operations team that partners directly with the Americas go-to-market (GTM) organization. The team supports d
  text: This is a collaborative, fast-moving environment where Revenue Operations works alongside sellers and leaders to improve revenue visibility,
