  text: You’ll be embedded in day-to-day GTM execution, responding to operational needs while contributing to longer-term improvements in revenue pr
# What you will do
  text: Revenue Reporting & Executive Analytics
  text: Provide day-to-day support to GTM team members with pipeline visibility, deal tracking, and reporting needs.
  text: Build, maintain, and refine operational dashboards and reports used in weekly GTM meetings, forecasting cadences, and executive reviews.
  text: Gather feedback from GTM teams and translate it into practical recommendations that improve sales processes, data quality, and operational e
  text: Sales Process, Forecasting & Day-to-Day GTM Support
  text: Partner with Americas GTM teams on active pipeline management, including opportunity structure, stage progression, data hygiene, and forecas
  text: Provide hands-on guidance on sales processes, opportunity hygiene, and Salesforce usage in support of active deals.
