  text: Experience in a regulated, data-driven, transaction-based, or enterprise software business.
  text: Ability to translate business needs into clear process and reporting recommendations.
  text: Strong communication and collaboration skills, with the confidence to partner across functions and levels.
  text: Curious, self-aware, and eager to learn; able to seek guidance, apply feedback, and transfer learning to new situations.
  text: Organized and detail-oriented, with the ability to manage multiple priorities and follow through on commitments.
  text: Proficiency with Salesforce and common GTM technologies.
  text: Experience creating or maintaining reports and dashboards in Salesforce, Power BI, or a comparable reporting tool.
